---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {posts,url} from '../../lib/content.mjs';
---
<Layout title="搜索内容"><div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">站内搜索</p><h1>找到你关心的内容<span>。</span></h1><p>搜索演示文章的标题、摘要与正文。</p></div><form id="search-form" role="search"><label for="query">搜索关键词</label><div class="search-box"><input id="query" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="试试“阅读”或“公开数据”" autocomplete="off"/><button type="submit">搜索 ↗</button></div></form><p id="search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">输入关键词开始搜索。</p><div id="results" class="listing">{posts.map(p=><article class="search-result" data-search={`${p.title} ${p.summary} ${p.body.map(b=>b.text).join(' ')}`.toLocaleLowerCase('zh-CN')}><p class="eyebrow">演示内容</p><h2><a href={url(`articles/${p.slug}/`)}>{p.title}</a></h2><p>{p.summary}</p></article>)}</div><noscript><p>搜索需要启用浏览器脚本。您仍可浏览上方全部文章或使用浏览器的页面查找功能。</p></noscript><script>const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#search-form')!;const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#query')!;const items=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-search]')];function search(){const q=input.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('zh-CN');let n=0;for(const item of items){item.hidden=!q||!q.split(/\s+/).every(term=>item.dataset.search!.includes(term));if(!item.hidden)n++}document.querySelector('#search-status')!.textContent=q?(n?`找到 ${n} 篇演示文章。`:'没有找到匹配内容，请尝试其他关键词。'):'输入关键词开始搜索。';const u=new URL(location.href);q?u.searchParams.set('q',input.value.trim()):u.searchParams.delete('q');history.replaceState(null,'',u)}input.value=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('q')?.slice(0,100)||'';search();form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();search()});input.addEventListener('input',search);</script></Layout>
